{"id":"B1-L136","title":"Reported Speech — production and review","cefr":"B1","level":"B1","unit":"B1-U08","focus":"Reported Speech — produção e revisão","targets":{"grammar":"Reported Speech — produção e revisão","pron":"Sentence stress","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["lost letter","young man","kind lady","festival crowd","grateful smile","handwritten note","stage play","theater scene","dialogue line","story ending","town festival","lost and found","thank-you gift","friendly chat","old lady","surprise meeting","written promise","bench corner"],"field":"Cultura","genre":"Conto e trecho de peça","skill":"Escuta","words_min":18},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 136 · Reported Speech — production and review","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Reported Speech — produção e revisão.","**Pronúncia:** Sentence stress.","**18 palavras novas** (cultura).","**Texto do dia:** conto e trecho de peça."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B1):** eu consigo narrar uma cena com discurso indireto num trecho de peça."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["lost letter","carta perdida"],["young man","jovem rapaz"],["kind lady","senhora gentil"],["festival crowd","multidão do festival"],["grateful smile","sorriso agradecido"],["handwritten note","bilhete manuscrito"],["stage play","peça de teatro"],["theater scene","cena de teatro"],["dialogue line","fala de diálogo"],["story ending","final de história"],["town festival","festa da cidade"],["lost and found","achados e perdidos"],["thank-you gift","presente de agradecimento"],["friendly chat","conversa amistosa"],["old lady","senhora idosa"],["surprise meeting","encontro surpresa"],["written promise","promessa escrita"],["bench corner","canto do banco"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short story","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The Letter at the Festival","paras":["At the festival, Mrs. Cruz **told** the young man that she **had found** his letter. He **said** he **was** grateful and **asked** her **where** she **had found** it. She **said** it **was** under a bench.","He **told** her he **would write** another one for her, because she **had been** so kind."],"kicker":"SHORT STORY","by":"Original story","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Mrs. Cruz found the letter.","ans":"T","why":"had found his letter."},{"q":"She found it in a bag.","ans":"F","why":"under a bench."},{"q":"He promised to write another letter.","ans":"T","why":"would write another."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“grateful” = ?","opts":["grato","grande","gratuito"],"ans":0,"why":"grateful."},{"q":"“bench” = ?","opts":["banco (de praça)","bancada","banco"],"ans":0,"why":"bench."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Discurso indireto: narrativa","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Direto","Indireto"],"rows":[["“I found your letter.”","**She told him she had found his letter.**"],["“Where did you find it?”","**He asked where she had found it.**"],["“I will write again.”","**He said he would write again.**"],["“I was grateful.”","**He said he was grateful.**"]],"cap":"Discurso indireto: narrativa"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Em perguntas indiretas a ordem volta a ser **afirmativa**: *He asked where she had found it* (✗ *where had she*)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"She told him she ___ found it. (have → had)","a":"had","why":"recuo."},{"s":"He asked ___ she had found it. (where)","a":"where","why":"pergunta indireta."},{"s":"He said he ___ write again. (will → would)","a":"would","why":"recuo."},{"s":"It was ___ a bench. (under)","a":"under","why":"preposição."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["lost letter","carta perdida"],["park bench","banco de parque"],["young man","jovem rapaz"],["kind lady","senhora gentil"],["festival crowd","multidão do festival"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["a","bench","Under"],"ans":"Under a bench","pt":"Debaixo de um banco."},{"words":["your","letter","I","found"],"ans":"I found your letter","pt":"Encontrei sua carta."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"lost letter","pos":"word","pt":"carta perdida","ex":"Lost letter.","expt":"Carta perdida."},{"w":"young man","pos":"word","pt":"jovem rapaz","ex":"Young man.","expt":"Jovem rapaz."},{"w":"kind lady","pos":"word","pt":"senhora gentil","ex":"Kind lady.","expt":"Senhora gentil."},{"w":"festival crowd","pos":"word","pt":"multidão do festival","ex":"Festival crowd.","expt":"Multidão do festival."},{"w":"grateful smile","pos":"word","pt":"sorriso agradecido","ex":"Grateful smile.","expt":"Sorriso agradecido."},{"w":"handwritten note","pos":"word","pt":"bilhete manuscrito","ex":"Handwritten note.","expt":"Bilhete manuscrito."},{"w":"stage play","pos":"word","pt":"peça de teatro","ex":"Stage play.","expt":"Peça de teatro."},{"w":"theater scene","pos":"word","pt":"cena de teatro","ex":"Theater scene.","expt":"Cena de teatro."},{"w":"dialogue line","pos":"word","pt":"fala de diálogo","ex":"Dialogue line.","expt":"Fala de diálogo."},{"w":"story ending","pos":"word","pt":"final de história","ex":"Story ending.","expt":"Final de história."},{"w":"town festival","pos":"word","pt":"festa da cidade","ex":"Town festival.","expt":"Festa da cidade."},{"w":"lost and found","pos":"word","pt":"achados e perdidos","ex":"Lost and found.","expt":"Achados e perdidos."},{"w":"thank-you gift","pos":"word","pt":"presente de agradecimento","ex":"Thank-you gift.","expt":"Presente de agradecimento."},{"w":"friendly chat","pos":"word","pt":"conversa amistosa","ex":"Friendly chat.","expt":"Conversa amistosa."},{"w":"old lady","pos":"word","pt":"senhora idosa","ex":"Old lady.","expt":"Senhora idosa."},{"w":"surprise meeting","pos":"word","pt":"encontro surpresa","ex":"Surprise meeting.","expt":"Encontro surpresa."},{"w":"written promise","pos":"word","pt":"promessa escrita","ex":"Written promise.","expt":"Promessa escrita."},{"w":"bench corner","pos":"word","pt":"canto do banco","ex":"Bench corner.","expt":"Canto do banco."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**No trouble at all.** — Sem problema algum.","**Much obliged.** — Muito agradecido.","**Lost and found.** — Achados e perdidos.","**I found your letter.** — Encontrei sua carta.","**Where did you find it?** — Onde a encontrou?","**Under a bench.** — Debaixo de um banco.","**Crack the code.** — Decifrar o código.","**Cry over spilled milk.** — Chorar pelo leite derramado."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"ask","pt":"perguntar","forms":[["I / you / we / they ask","I ask a question."],["he / she / it asks","Faço uma pergunta."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Scene","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Scene","lines":[["Mrs. Cruz","I found your letter.","Encontrei sua carta."],["Man","Where did you find it?","Onde a encontrou?"],["Mrs. Cruz","Under a bench.","Debaixo de um banco."],["Man","I will write you another one.","Vou escrever outra para a senhora."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Sentence stress","items":[{"label":"Sentence stress","note":"Na frase, acentue palavras de conteúdo (substantivos, verbos, adjetivos) e reduza as funcionais: I WANT to LEARN ENglish.","words":["I want to learn English.","She has studied for years.","Can you help me?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Report a question.","pt":"Relate.","model":"He asked where I lived."},{"q":"Report a promise.","pt":"Relate.","model":"She said she would call."},{"q":"Report a thank you.","pt":"Relate.","model":"He said he was grateful."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 6 lines of a story using reported speech.","model":"Mrs. Cruz told the young man that she had found his letter. He said he was grateful. He asked where she had found it. She said it was under a bench. He told her he would write another one. She smiled and said it was no trouble.","checklist":["Usei **said/told/asked**","Perguntas indiretas","História curta"],"words":"6 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “lost letter” mean?","opts":["carta perdida","banco de parque","senhora gentil"],"ans":0,"why":"**lost letter** = carta perdida."},{"q":"What does “park bench” mean?","opts":["jovem rapaz","banco de parque","multidão do festival"],"ans":1,"why":"**park bench** = banco de parque."},{"q":"What does “young man” mean?","opts":["senhora gentil","sorriso agradecido","jovem rapaz"],"ans":2,"why":"**young man** = jovem rapaz."},{"q":"What does “kind lady” mean?","opts":["senhora gentil","multidão do festival","bilhete manuscrito"],"ans":0,"why":"**kind lady** = senhora gentil."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}